OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies involvement in
OL,4,Ahistorical child sexual exploitation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied historical offences
OL,7,Frelating to the alleged sexual abuse
OL,8,Fand rape of children as part of a
OL,9,Fgrooming gang operating in south Wales.
OL,11,FMohammed Ramzan, 76, is among nine men
OL,12,Fwho were charged as part of an
OL,13,Finvestigation into reports made by
OL,14,Fwomen of sexual abuse committed against
OL,15,Fthem as children in the 1980s and
OL,16,F1990s.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
