OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies involvement in
OL,4,Ahistorical child sexual exploitation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRamzan, from Newport, pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to one count of causing
OL,8,Fprostitution, two counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcounts of indecent assault and one
OL,10,Fcount of aiding and abetting rape at
OL,11,FCardiff Crown Court on Friday.
OL,13,FHe was released on conditional bail,
OL,14,Fand a trial date for January 2028 was
OL,15,Fset by Judge Lloyd-Clarke.
